<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, my All in all Thou art,</l><l>My rest in toil, mine ease in pain;</l><l>The med’cine of my broken heart;</l><l>In war, my peace; in loss, my gain;</l><l>My smile beneath the tyrant’s frown;</l><l>In shame, my glory and my crown.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In want, my plentiful supply;</l><l>In weakness, mine almighty power;</l><l>In bonds, my perfect liberty;</l><l>My light in Satan’s darkest hour;</l><l>In grief, my joy unspeakable;</l><l>My life in death; my Lord, my all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
